OL,3,GNEWSAInspector to review controversial
OL,4,Ahomes plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA planning inspector will examine
OL,7,Fproposals for tens of thousands of
OL,8,Fhomes after the government ordered the
OL,9,Flocal authority to speed up the
OL,10,Fprocess.
OL,12,FWest Northamptonshire Council's draft
OL,13,Flocal plan could see up to 47,300 homes
OL,14,Fbuilt across the area by 2043.
OL,16,FIn September, the Reform UK-led council
OL,17,Fvoted to go back to the drawing board
OL,18,Fand start a new local plan from
OL,19,Fscratch.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
